Product: 6v; Yield: 88%.
(E)-6-Benzoyl-(2-(2-(benzo[1,3]dioxol-5-yl)vinyl)-1Hbenzimidazole (6v).
Dark brown crystals. M.p>240 °C, IR (KBr, ν max in cm-1): 3422 (-NH),
2917 (=C-H), 1644 (C=N), 1575 (C=C), 1609 (C=O), 1H NMR (DMSO-d6 , 400
MHz) δ ppm: 2.5 (s, 2H, -CH2), 6.24 (d, 1H, -C=CH-, vinylic proton, J H-H
= 16.4 Hz), 7.0-8.0 (m, 6 aryl, 5 phenyl and 1 vinylic protons, J H-H =
16.4 Hz), 9.8 (s, 1H, -NH of benzimidazole), 13C NMR (DMSO-d6 , 100 MHz)δ
ppm: 114.30, 115.04, 116.96, 125.42, 128.45, 128.68, 129.12, 129.30,
129.48, 129.59 129.60 (2 quaternary carbons common to benzene and
imidazole rings), 131.08, 132.22, 132.33, 133.76, 134.37, 137.58, 137.64,
137.74, 195.17 (1 dioxymethylene carbon, 10 aryl carbons, 6 phenylic
carbons, 2 vinylic carbons, 1 imidazole quaternary carbon, 1 carbonyl
carbon), MS (m/z): 369.2 (M+ .), Anal. Calcd. for C23H16N2O3: C, 74.99;
H, 4.38; N, 7.60; O, 13.03 % Found: C, 75.02; H, 4.42; N, 7.77; O, 13.12
%.
